But at the same time, for me, there was a joy to it.

1106
00:56:10.220 --> 00:56:15.060
You know, when you, you're crying with joy because it wasn't even sadness.

1107
00:56:15.360 --> 00:56:16.300
Like, because I was ready.

1108
00:56:16.400 --> 00:56:17.160
I was ready to go.

1109
