1115
00:56:31.060 --> 00:56:31.980
to be pursued.

1116
00:56:31.980 --> 00:56:36.960
It was just, I think it was the right, it was, the timing was right, I think for everybody.

1117
00:56:37.180 --> 00:56:43.580
But simultaneously, there was just a sense of joy for me that we had experienced all

1118
00:56:43.580 --> 00:56:43.980
of this.

1119
00:56:44.180 --> 00:56:49.820
And we were getting, I was getting a chance to kind of take a lap with everybody.

1120
00:56:50.060 --> 00:56:54.800
And the way, you know, those last few episodes were structured, it felt very rich to me to

1121
