kind of simultaneously be saying goodbye as Michael and, you know, us as, as friends,

1122
00:57:02.260 --> 00:57:05.200
you know, in this moment of work together.

1123
00:57:05.200 --> 00:57:07.240
But yeah, it was a lot.

1124
00:57:07.380 --> 00:57:09.260
It was a very emotional thing.

1125
00:57:09.480 --> 00:57:10.140
It was.

1126
